Package: ipa_labels
Title: Dynamic International Phonetic Alphabet Lookup Database
Version: 0.2.0
Author: Cong
Maintainer: Cong <user@example.com>
Description: A comprehensive, multilayered phonetic database and lookup utility for the International Phonetic Alphabet (IPA). Allows looking up IPA symbols by their descriptions, names, Hex/Decimal values, TIPA LaTeX macros, AF II codes, SAMPA/X-SAMPA, and ARPABET representations. Reads the underlying CSV file dynamically at runtime.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.2.3
Depends: R (>= 3.5)
Imports: utils, jsonlite
